WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.768
A screen can pass a demo
while the operation still fails.

00:00:03.917 --> 00:00:08.852
Nepsis tests the people, states,
decisions and exceptions together.

00:00:09.472 --> 00:00:14.826
The site supervisor runs the normal case.
The consultant does not narrate every click.

00:00:14.886 --> 00:00:22.720
The supervisor identifies the machine, records it ready,
and makes or records the collection request.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:28.705
The route works when the people doing the job
can follow it without coaching.

00:00:29.325 --> 00:00:38.808
Then the consultant steps away.
The builder is gone and the user owns the next action.

00:00:39.428 --> 00:00:46.102
Handoff includes the operating note, named owner,
normal path, fallback and exception route.

00:00:46.162 --> 00:00:49.199
The consultant leaves the path;
the team keeps running it.

00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:55.778
Bring one workflow your team works around.
Start with the free consultation and Basic Diagnosis.
